$-nullclines for the corresponding phase space.\n$\\,$\nThe $x$-nullcline is $y=$ {{field-1}}. \n\n$\\,$\nThe $y$-nullcline is $y=$ {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "Recall that: \n\n- The $x$-nullcline is a line for which ${x}^{′}=0$ (i.e., the tangents to trajectories are vertical). So, to find it, we set the first equation of the system equal to $0:$\n\n$$\nx-3y=0\\,⇒\\,y=\\frac{1}{3}x\n$$\n\n- The $y$-nullcline is a line for which ${y}^{′}=0$ (i.e., the tangents to trajectories are horizontal). So, to find it, we set the second equation of the system equal to $0:$\n\n$$\n4x+y=0\\,⇒\\,y=-4x\n$$\n\nPlotting these in the phase space, we obtain the following:\n\n![](images/1d/1dd7f0c522e3b4d8daaf25ea45ac21c01508cf4c969d3d00638604e9686b7e68.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186305082 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1551f4a5-dae3-5ce8-9874-19deb28fe53b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302596} {:answer/id #uuid "81088a52-d916-5ce8-9500-8a123fc38199" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303261} {:answer/id #uuid "866dee66-6851-5ab3-a4b8-754c3117166b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303294} {:answer/id #uuid "eae1d62c-67fc-5cd7-983c-796d682969ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303922}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186303922} :answer-field/id #uuid "71f6519c-9ab9-58ee-9274-1ab2a3a63bf9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304387} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5f1e255c-4240-5fd0-960a-20f0a5cc84ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-3x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303036} {:answer/id #uuid "6b7c0e3a-9a6c-5c78-b902-601b31299300" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{3}