The $x$-nullcline is $y=$ {{field-1}}. \n\n$\\,$\nThe $y$-nullcline is $y=$ {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "Recall that: \n\n- The $x$-nullcline is a line for which ${x}^{′}=0$ (i.e., the tangents to trajectories are vertical). So, to find it, we set the first equation of the system equal to $0:$\n\n$$\n2x-y=0\\,⇒\\,y=2x\n$$\n\n- The $y$-nullcline is a line for which ${y}^{′}=0$ (i.e., the tangents to trajectories are horizontal). So, to find it, we set the second equation of the system equal to $0:$\n\n$$\n-x-3y=0\\,⇒\\,y=-\\frac{1}{3}x\n$$\n\nPlotting these in the phase space, we obtain the following:\n\n![](images/a9/a9c0fb2365806ddb02ff8c60a618aabf4cc825917c29fb472ee3bab2492b9033.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186305150 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2bc5840d-df3a-5b74-8181-83436432532c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/72/7271950b4d1a418f75a7b56cb3d379247a8d961d698e8bb543c0c03f642dac5c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302734} {:answer/id #uuid "6a277581-178e-519e-9035-cf40c73d2ae1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/6e/6e69df0c92766ad42e3f94a5850398a17de7973dc6bffae673cc51ec6b3d8a60.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303105} {:answer/id #uuid "8eead6c5-0447-5b59-a92f-32a3804d1344" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/ce/ce3c4ce548b279031bf389ba3f702fa199b80bcb03026b5a810dc06420230bc2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303345} {:answer/id #uuid "cb9680d0-5b57-55d1-99f1-09782dd8ce68" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/7e/7eec8613842a46350b767578048fbe2e7ebe83b2bc7c8f8f32e2a3f907041aa1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303709} {:answer/id #uuid "d0b9250b-e1e7-5b77-bb2c-12bf4b8acc99" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/32/324e0b4bd69cd58af8df8d7ca8c1e6f454e492d9c8b3994fb34d020df22b58ad.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303742}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186303709} :answer-field/id #uuid "8c3442e2-a9e3-5293-8111-ef8514d2881f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304450}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "35337a3f-ac92-585a-ac00-7470310565dd" :question/math-academy-id "q-332917" :question/problem "![](images/e8/e80a2dc709410228439b5acffe70a8df5e60a2e593a8dc142d373dc63d95956b.png)\n\nA sketch of the phase space with nullclines and the corresponding direction field of tangents to the solutions of a system of differential equations is shown above (the tangents are not drawn to scale). Which of the following could represent the trajectory starting at the point marked on the graph?" :question/worked-solution "Let's sketch the trajectory.\n\n- We start at the given point and go along with the flow (slightly downward and to the right) until the trajectory intersects the $y$-nullcline, where the tangents are horizontal.\n\n![](images/65/659a566b441d61748a82d4c8b67632432656fad3f8af65cd3a6446062c957817.png)\n\n- Next, the flow continues going to the right but then turns upward.\n\n![](images/2e/2e844f0034ee039a7a97c836099caa983eca9c861d66337772203db991d0f07d.png)\n\n- After that, the trajectory keeps going  to the right and slightly upward to infinity.\n\n![](images/b2/b21e1215502adee98e275e59d1a391665f3cc8b75a69b8c5497739d2b919cc9f.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186305151 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "164d1e87-792c-5a2c-b9a5-2bef16420c8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/33/33362c92cf128a95644e23ea5571040307975c305aea1a7136b3a0aca6d74afa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302600} {:answer/id #uuid "3def65d7-b64a-5a02-9e52-e753770bb30b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/3c/3c771573470c8914a3222ca363ae90b2603118961bd1fb3e36bd38235a70f348.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302845} {:answer/id #uuid "d6595f71-849a-5074-87b4-2e5d201e65f5" :ans