ter that, the trajectory proceeds almost horizontally to the left, going to infinity.\n\n![](images/48/48d82dd8338c251969e29c2bfb238c6ab0ded096434abacb3ebc47954635cd9e.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308342 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "61df7f22-6ffa-57a8-9916-b16cd0e6d7a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/7d/7d6d07e888cd0dd55fd37a8a620c8be054eee0e6abc170133a4188667dcc65b4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306098} {:answer/id #uuid "7e88af57-d11c-5f11-ae26-c363739c22eb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/6e/6e2e7d099ed478a259b241320481c4beacda56cea59adc2c7314636f42e79f3e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306363} {:answer/id #uuid "9713628a-50bc-55aa-9c55-eaff442a58c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/0e/0eff17334f3ca56152140bfefaf10a3169ad34a8b6e1e3322bd7fb03963c2338.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306572} {:answer/id #uuid "be682b22-dd95-5509-aae0-426f78a07495" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/f1/f128b9d7ed44f4b0e7c40177e7198c0593f6ff9b262fae153ffbfad963d00873.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306926} {:answer/id #uuid "c90626e8-1636-5700-ba43-5e845dd15842" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/f9/f906ea39089da431a1b86d3e7b8ab68ff7a287f8c4af4c3a5b9c1117eff2b57b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307022}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186306572} :answer-field/id #uuid "b8399834-d23a-59a9-8ff6-060b534eecb5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186308106}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "2dfbad27-2f3a-51d2-ab57-9054aa8268d1" :question/math-academy-id "q-332932" :question/problem "![](images/83/83147b64f8f34d43b9503186f3d2df5926ce119953c80d10f4cd8b8ef94bfcfc.png)\n\nA sketch of the phase space with nullclines and the corresponding direction field of tangents to the solutions of a system of differential equations is shown above (the tangents are not drawn to scale). Which of the following could represent the trajectory starting at the point marked on the graph?" :question/worked-solution "Let's sketch the trajectory.\n\n- We start at the given point, going along with the flow (upward and slightly to the right) until the trajectory intersects the $x$-nullcline, where the tangents are vertical.\n\n![](images/6d/6d897c2e9249447cc2d0c902a592d04442b0928c315163b6ab80cff288c84657.png)\n\n- Next, the flow continues going upward but then starts turning  to the left.\n\n![](images/be/bed6896ecc0edcdb157b648108d403e1b8e29463d9f61aa0e0c26e8f5e2dd8c6.png)\n\n- After that, the trajectory continues upward and slightly to the left, suggesting that it may converge to the origin\n\n![](images/cc/cc53577a278595e5f0155119aa5eb1a7b27ec01847a6daa1ba6ade6792c5f5e9.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308347 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c0c55dc-b1c1-5646-a713-430003933ea4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/fe/fe487e378dd633f91ee7cf1243312631695a5c750f8c0a0c888c9f2c86268ed3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305408} {:answer/id #uuid "39318c6c-0175-58b9-9483-19bb54b37393" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/d0/d0601c8b18b3a3b0b8c9388818b750c3d4cd36c89c1d4b854fc145a437d34ae0.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305698} {:answer/id #uuid "5f79e061-0ddd-5e61-bbe3-8f6ef1c7b823" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/4c/4c4388dd27a0306f274674c2fa41b042bbe03a43dec59e7f93d02d0cab35ebb2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306070} {:answer/id #uuid "735e27e3-7e5f-5b07-894b-9f6f0442c6e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/b3/b3f8771ae6044e667c42c48f92800117ff55e494c6e2521bca5071f206e234ef.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306247} {:answer/id #uuid "b745b80e-3479-54c7-bd02-80b273fdb7e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218604549